{
  "_comment": "The one list of the shared pieces of the user interface (the dictation button, the speaker button): who shows them, where their copies go, and who else uses the suites. scripts/sync_ui.py reads it; a program that takes speech in or reads aloud comes in here, and a copy that is not in it never gets the piece. Paths are relative to the folder that holds the repos next to this one.",
  "sources": {
    "badge": { "folder": "STT-Suite/ui/badge" },
    "speaker": { "folder": "TTS-Suite/src/tts_suite/service/ui/speaker" }
  },
